    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "interesting. so when you say drill is \"niche street culture\" with \"low social capital,\" are you saying that because the lyrical content and imagery are tied to specific urban environments? like, is there an inherent lack of sophistication in the genre itself, or is it just how the market perceives it? i'm trying to figure out if we should advise our luxury clients to avoid these demographics entirely to protect their brand image.",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
